{"parse": {"title": "DC-05", "pageid": 110502, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DC-04\" title=\"DC-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DC-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/DC-06\" title=\"DC-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8D.83.E4.B8.87.E6.B3.95.E9.83.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"千万法郎\">千万法郎</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 千万法郎</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Ten Million Francs</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>追<span class=\"color-value\"></span>问<span class=\"color-value\"></span>隐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>私<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>对<span class=\"color-value\"></span>方<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>全<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>托<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192505</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>没想到我们这么快就又见面了，弗雷明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>德洛姆坐在柜台内，从厚重玻璃墙的窗口中探出一颗小脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>我听说你刚做成一桩大买卖，到手的钱这么快就花完了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗雷明：</div><div>不要在不该问的地方多嘴，德洛姆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>当然，我关心的只有你身上那把漂亮的小手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗雷明摆出一道鄙夷的目光，但还是顺从地将一只普通的木质小盒摆上柜台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只枯瘦的手伸过柜台，拿走小盒，轻轻打开后又迅速关闭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>就是它，你终于舍得割爱了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗雷明：</div><div>我要一千万，现金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手枪盒被推回玻璃幕墙之外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗雷明：</div><div>该死的，这是“慈祥的玛利亚”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>我看是“贪婪的弗雷明”，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>这把小手枪背后有一个动听的故事，但也不值得我给出一千万，何况它根本来路不明，烫手得很。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>而且我说过，在你犹豫的这一段时间里，我的估价会不断下跌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗雷明再次把手枪盒推回柜台内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗雷明：</div><div>九百万。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>八百万，包括所有权的转移。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗雷明：</div><div>……成交！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>来，在这里签字，款项马上会打给你——当然，还要除去五个点的手续费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗雷明：</div><div>你这个道德败坏的老酒鬼，等我发了财，我会让你好受的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他潦草地签上了自己的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛姆：</div><div>那我很期待和一个更富有的弗雷明打交道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗雷明踏着响亮的步子离开大厅。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一间普通而老旧的旅馆，刚好与典当行隔街相望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坦南特靠在窗边，把玩着左轮手枪。窗角的蛛丝在阳光下若隐若现，等待着不幸的蚊虫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>弗雷明已经在典当行里待了二十分钟了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你觉得他能把枪卖到一千万？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弹巢弹出，在拇指的驱动下飞速旋转，转瞬间又被甩回原位。<br />——空仓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>不，德洛姆不会这么大方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>这个老狐狸虽然嗜酒如命，但他在谈到钱的时候，比任何人都清醒和吝啬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>他一眼就能看出弗雷明非常焦急，一定会把价格压低。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>七百万？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弹巢再次转动，停止。仍是空仓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>太少了，“慈祥的玛利亚”不会只值这个价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>阿德丽塔为了得到它，可是准备了许多真钻石和“南非盒子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呵呵……八百万？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弹巢第三次转动，带起细微的呼啸声，弗雷明此时出现在坦南特的视野中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坦南特按住弹巢，一颗钻石子弹蓄势待发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>从他的表情来看，这个数字也许没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>八百万也是一个不错的收获，可以买下一套圣勒梅兹的别墅，附带第二帝国时期的石砌壁炉和南部阳光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>更重要的是，它经过了电气化改造，能够支撑起现代生活必备的一切要素。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>金钱不是这场游戏的目的。<br />一千万是不能退让的底线，这样才能展示出索求者的真诚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>弗雷明精力充沛，想象力旺盛，我相信他有办法凑出剩下的二百万。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你该回到你的小实验室去了，弗雷明会带着第一笔钱登门拜访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>不，他不会去的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坦南特目送窗外的弗雷明转身没入小巷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>弗雷明和所有轻信而贪婪的人相比，并无二致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>当他第一次在实验室见到人工钻石的时候，兴奋会冲昏他的头脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>可现在，离最初的激动已经过去了二十四小时。<br />与此同时，弗雷明刚刚当掉了他视若珍宝的手枪，手中揣着沉甸甸的现金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>这些因素都会迫使他进入一段“冷静期”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>他会想到，在把钱脱手之前，应该去查一查“布蕾特·科赛特”到底是什么人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-305120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，布蕾特马上就要被揭穿了，她究竟要如何应对呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>当然是真诚相待——始终如一。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DC-05"}}